(1, 'Cách dùng Vitamin C', 'Mẹo sức khỏe', 'Lưu ý khi bổ sung Vitamin C...', '<h1 class=\"diag-title mb-4\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Cách dùng Vitamin C hiệu quả và lưu ý để tránh tác dụng phụ</h1><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><div class=\"post-social d-flex gap-3\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"post-social-item\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fdiag.vn%2Fblog%2Fnutrition%2Fcach-dung-vitamin-c-hieu-qua-va-luu-y%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"blue-background rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-primary\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgb(234, 243, 255); width: 2rem; height: 2rem; color: rgb(7, 102, 247) !important;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" style=\"height: 16px;  fill: #0766F7;\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"post-social-item\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=C%C3%A1ch+d%C3%B9ng+Vitamin+C+hi%E1%BB%87u+qu%E1%BA%A3+v%C3%A0+l%C6%B0u+%C3%BD+%C4%91%E1%BB%83+tr%C3%A1nh+t%C3%A1c+d%E1%BB%A5ng+ph%E1%BB%A5&url=https%3A%2F%2Fdiag.vn%2Fblog%2Fnutrition%2Fcach-dung-vitamin-c-hieu-qua-va-luu-y%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"blue-background rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-primary\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgb(234, 243, 255); width: 2rem; heig